                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 2301](https://titanium.com/ams-2301-specification/) , [AMS 6346](https://titanium.com/ams-6346-specification/) , [AMS 6348](https://titanium.com/ams-6348-specification/) , [AMS 6370](https://titanium.com/ams-6370-specification/) , [AMS-S-6758](https://titanium.com/ams-s-6758-specification/)"
